# VoCat no longer stores administrator credentials in .env.
# Initialize a new Docker database with the bootstrap-admin command documented
# at the top of docker-compose.yml. Keep this file only for optional, non-secret
# Compose substitutions added by an operator.
# Call recordings default to <database-directory>/recordings (private files).
# For a native service, optional server configuration:
# VOCAT_RECORDINGS_DIRECTORY=/opt/vocat/data/recordings
# A custom systemd directory also needs an appropriate ReadWritePaths override;
# a custom container directory needs a persistent writable volume.
